// ======================= API.gs (v66, hook points marked __genId) =======================
/**
 * ===================================================================
 * API.gs  —  تطبيق المتابعة  —  Secure backend v2
 * Google Apps Script Web App connected to the spreadsheet "Alasala New".
 *
 * What changed vs v1 (summary):
 *  - No master PIN. Per-teacher PIN stored as a salted SHA-256 hash (column PIN_HASH).
 *  - Brute-force protection (5 failures => 15 min lock for that e-mail).
 *  - Session tokens (CacheService, 6h). EVERY read/write except login needs a token.
 *  - Identity always comes from the session, never from the client payload.
 *  - Course/student ownership by exact keys (course teacher name or exact code prefix),
 *    never by fuzzy name matching. One scope function is used by reads AND writes.
 *  - Header-driven column detection (no silent hard-coded fallbacks).
 *  - Writes touch only the cells they must (never formula columns J/K of the course
 *    sheet, never column S of the students sheet) and run under LockService.
 *  - Attendance is an UPSERT (re-sending a session never duplicates rows).
 *  - v50 hardening: no clear PIN is ever written to the spreadsheet (they go to the editor's
 *    execution log only); longer PINs; progressive lockout (durable for real accounts);
 *    a global cap on failed logins; slow "h2" PIN hashes (old "h1" hashes migrate on login);
 *    per-account session version (a PIN reset or «قطع الجلسات» ends every open session);
 *    formula-safe writes everywhere; JSONP removed.
 *  - v62 المناطق: «المعتمديات» = 1676 places (معتمدية / عمادة / حي), a صف is inherited from the معتمدية;
 *    the forms only accept a place of the list (server-checked).
 *  - v61 الصف حسب المنطقة: «المعتمديات» (70 معتمدية + أحياء) decides a person's صف from «الحيّ / المدينة»;
 *    fallback = المقر / المدرس; A4 teaches unknown spellings once («actAreaLearn»).
 *  - v60 الدرس العام: a newcomer (name + phone) becomes a member of الرواد whose course is the public lesson
 *    («الدرس العام فقط»); search limited to the lesson's الصنف; taps are saved in the background, grouped.
 *  - v59 الدرس العام: a newcomer fills the full «طلب درس» form; «mark all the regulars»; the search accepts
 *    close spellings (أ/ا, ة/ه, ؤ/و, ئ/ي, «ال», one or two letters off).
 *  - v58 speed: a write only renews the cached copy of the sheets it changes (WRITES_SPEC_, checked by the
 *    tests on every write); a hand edit only the edited sheet. PIN hash 1000 → 100 rounds.
 *  - v57 speed: background warm-up of the read cache (trigger), measureSpeed() for real timings,
 *    the app loads the first department only and the others in the background.
 *  - v55: حضور الدرس العام — A1/A2/A3 of the area (A4 everywhere) record who came, newcomers become course
 *    requests, one row per person/date/lesson (no duplicates), one shared count of unnamed attendees.
 *  - v53: new PINs also go to a separate private file in the owner's Drive (PIN_EXPORT_FILE).
 *  - v52 البرامج: a member's صف comes from the course's المقر + the member's الصنف when that pair has a
 *    single صف; صفوف المدرسين is only needed where an المقر has several صفوف for the same الصنف,
 *    and a member is never placed in a صف of the other الصنف.
 *  - v51 speed: read-only actions read a server-side snapshot of the sheets (CacheService,
 *    PIN hashes removed, invalidated by every write and by hand edits through
 *    installCacheTrigger); writes always read the live sheet. A PIN is hashed once per login.
 * ===================================================================
 */

